		{
			"id":"51b8d2f43b6a5c73",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"basically i just think that this will be components that detect certain stimulus and update the esoterica live (or get piped through a component which then updates the esoterica directly)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-400,
			"y":2990,
			"width":440,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"c0eba2de09cba4bc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"this can probably be done the same way that i've done the heartbeat effect thing wahtever: with a generic resource / execution component combo",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":140,
			"y":2880,
			"width":480,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"333e307733a73016",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```gdscript\nextends Resource\nclass_name EsotericaStimulus\n\nfunc get_delta(context: Dictionary) -> Esoterica:\n\treturn Esoterica.new() # override: DamageTakenStimulus, PreyEatenStimulus, IdleDecayStimulus, etc.\n```\n\n```gdscript\nextends Component\nclass_name EsotericaStimulusComponent\n\n@export var stimulus: EsotericaStimulus\nvar interface: AnthuriumInterface\n\nfunc trigger(context: Dictionary = {}) -> void:\n\tinterface.esoterica.add(stimulus.get_delta(context))\n```\n\nfor example, a damage stimulus\n\n```gdscript\nextends EsotericaStimulus\nclass_name PredatorBiteStimulus\n\n@export var felicity_delta: float = -5.0\n@export var furor_delta: float = 1.0\n@export var scale_with_damage: bool = true\n\nfunc get_delta(context: Dictionary) -> void:\n\tvar scale: float = context.get(\"damage\", 1.0) if scale_with_damage else 1.0\n\treturn Esoterica.new(felicity_delta * scale, furor_delta * scale, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n```\n\n```gdscript\nextends Component\nclass_name EsotericaStimulusComponent\n\n@export var stimulus: EsotericaStimulus\nvar interface: AnthuriumInterface\n\nfunc trigger(context: Dictionary = {}) -> void:\n\tinterface.esoterica.add(stimulus.get_delta(context))\n\n\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1160,
			"y":3700,
			"width":760,
			"height":1020
		},
		{
			"id":"e361b50edf152d2f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n```gdscript\nextends Variant\nclass_name Esoterica\n\nvar felicity: float\nvar furor: float\nvar lacuna: float\nvar tremendum: float\nvar acedia: float\nvar anamnesis: float\n\nfunc _init(fe: float = 0.0, fu: float = 0.0, la: float = 0.0, tr: float = 0.0, ac: float = 0.0, an: float = 0.0) -> void:\n\tfelicity = fe\n\tfuror = fu\n\tlacuna = la\n\ttremendum = tr\n\tacedia = ac\n\tanamnesis = an\n\nfunc to_array() -> Array[float]:\n\treturn [felicity, furor, lacuna, tremendum, acedia, anamnesis]\n\nfunc magnitude() -> float:\n\treturn sqrt(felicity**2 + furor**2 + lacuna**2 + tremendum**2 + acedia**2 + anamnesis**2)\n\nfunc normalized() -> Esoterica:\n\tvar m: float = magnitude()\n\tif m == 0.0: return Esoterica.new()\n\treturn Esoterica.new(felicity/m, furor/m, lacuna/m, tremendum/m, acedia/m, anamnesis/m)\n\nfunc dot(other: Esoterica) -> float:\n\treturn felicity*other.felicity + furor*other.furor + lacuna*other.lacuna + tremendum*other.tremendum + acedia*other.acedia + anamnesis*other.anamnesis\n\nfunc cosine_similarity(other: Esoterica) -> float:\n\tvar denom: float = magnitude() * other.magnitude\n\tif denom == 0.0: return 0.0\n\treturn dot(other) / denom\n\nfunc add(other: Esoterica) -> void:\n\tfelicity += other.felicity\n\tfuror += other.furor\n\tlacuna += other.lacuna\n\ttremendum += other.tremendum\n\tacedia += other.acedia\n\tanamnesis += other.anamnesis\n\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":640,
			"y":3700,
			"width":1140,
			"height":980
		},
		{
			"id":"43081c816931e428",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```gdscript\nextends Node\nclass_name AnthuriumInterface\n\nvar esoterica: Esoterica\n\nfunc select_bloom_event(esoterica: Esoterica) -> BloomEvent:\n\tvar best_event: BloomEvent\n\tvar best_score: float = -INF\n\tfor event in bloom_events:\n\t\tvar similarity: float = esoterica.cosine_similarity(event.archetype)\n\t\tif similarity > best_score:\n\t\t\tbest_score = similarity\n\t\t\tbest_event = event\n\treturn best_event\n\t\nfunc trigger_bloom(source: Entity) -> void:\n\tvar esoterica: Esoterica = get_current_esoterica()\n\tvar event: BloomEvent = select_bloom_event(esoterica)\n\tvar potency: float = esoterica.magnitude()\n\tevent.execute(potency)\n\nfunc grow_new_accessory(source: Entity) -> Entity:\n\t# some algorithm to determine which type of plant part to spawn in\n\tvar accessory: Entity\n\treturn accessory\n\nfunc grow_new_root(source: Entity) -> Entity:\n\t# some algorithm to pick an angle and distance from the source\n\t# pick the right sprite\n\tvar root: Entity\n\treturn root\n\nfunc get_current_esoterica() -> Esoterica:\n\treturn esoterica\n```\n\n",
